OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 5 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,5,     GBartok meets a fellow folk song
OL,6,     Gcollector. Donald Macleod
OL,7,     Gexplores the life of one of
OL,8,     GHungary's greatest composers, who
OL,9,     Gtravelled Europe recording folk
OL,10,     Gsongs.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GOli Julian talks to Katie about
OL,13,     Ghis score for Amandaland. John
OL,14,     GTams and Sally Swanson perform
OL,15,     Glive from the music of War Horse.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,19,     Gfrom composers such as Debussy,
OL,20,     GRavel and Vivaldi.
